On these outputs, BrickMore has the highest mean on each of the three text--image metrics. BrickMore and BrickGPT both have a mean $P_{\mathrm{inv}}$ of 0.00\%; this measure does not distinguish them in the main comparison. Against BrickGPT, BrickMore scores higher on 91, 95, and 91 prompts for VQAScore, PE, and SigLIP2, respectively. The supplied analysis does not report a significance test.

The mean numbers of parts are 413.0 for BrickMore, 152.3 for BrickGPT, and 23.3 for BrickNet. These differences describe the evaluated structures and should be considered when interpreting the scores; part count alone does not measure generation quality.

